[Music]  meagan Markel has officially stepped out  with queen elizabeth the 36 year old  actress has been busy gearing up for her  may 19th nuptials to Prince Harry but on  Monday she took a break from all the  wedding planning to attend her first  royal public event alongside her majesty  at the Commonwealth service at  Westminster Abbey the humanitarian wowed  in white for the occasion donning a  cream-colored  Amanda Wakeley coat a white Stephen  Jones hat Navy Manolo Blahnik heels and  a matching mulberry clutch and yes her  fiance was by her side  Queen Elizabeth looked equally regal in  this all burgundy ensemble while Kate  Middleton who is pregnant with her third  child and Prince William wowed in navy  during the Commonwealth Day service  Markel was caught on camera singing the  national anthem of the United Kingdom  God saved the Queen  [Music]  having Meaghan at the event was a break  in royal protocol for the Queen but it's  not the first time she has made an  exception for the former suit star to  join them prior to exchanging vows with  Harry the bride-to-be was previously  invited to spend Christmas with the  family and even attended their Christmas  Day service

